{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"Let me reconsider the puzzle structure carefully. The key constraint is \"the award itself was originally created in the 2000s.\" The Booker Prize (1969) doesn't fit, but the Man Booker International Prize was inaugurated in 2005 (the 2000s).\n\nLet me reconsider: maybe the puzzle is about the regular Booker Prize, and \"originally created in the 2000s\" refers to something else. Or maybe I should look at this differently. Let me reconsider the Obioma lead - \"An Orchestra of Minorities\" (2019) was shortlisted for the Booker Prize. In 2019, the Booker was won by \"The Testaments\" (Margaret Atwood) and \"Girl, Woman, Other\" (Bernardine Evaristo). But the Booker Prize was created in 1969, not the 2000s.\n\nLet me reconsider whether the puzzle might involve a different award. Let me check the Man Booker International Prize 2019 winner (Celestial Bodies by Jokha Alharthi) and see if there's a book translated into 25+ languages that was a contender. Let me also reconsider the structure: maybe Book A is a contender for the International Booker Prize, and in the year it was published, another book won the International Booker Prize.\n\nLet me look at the International Booker Prize shortlists and winners in the 2010s more carefully.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"International Booker Prize shortlist 2019 2018 2017 2016 books\", \"Man Booker International Prize 2016 The Vegetarian Han Kang winner shortlist\", \"book translated 30 languages shortlisted International Booker Prize\"]}","name":"search"},"id":"call_f144e13c355e4dc4991a7698","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"The Remainder Alia Trabucco Zeran translated languages\", \"The Shape of the Ruins Juan Gabriel Vasquez translated languages\", \"The Labyrinth of Spirits Juan Gabriel Vasquez International Booker\"]}","name":"search"},"id":"call_19f5f55f5ac84a8e8069aa85","index":1,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789472949,"id":"chatcmpl-26ef370c-5c98-96f4-914b-cee66cc77fe4","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":19002,"completion_tokens":398,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":19400,"cached_tokens":3328,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":3328},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}